                     <provenance type="#rejected"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_330">London, London,
                           Cathedral church of St Paul</orgName>
                        <p>This attribution was rejected in the second edition of Medieval Libraries
                           of Great Britain (1964), which did not change in the Supplement (1987).
